<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.header {
  height: 65pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 18pt 40pt;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 26pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  padding: 12pt 40pt 70pt 40pt;
  flex: 1;
}
.summary {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  padding: 8pt 10pt;
  margin-bottom: 10pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 6pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}
.summary h2 {
  font-size: 12pt;
  color: #D4AF37;
  margin: 0 0 5pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.summary p {
  font-size: 9pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.strategies {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10pt;
}
.strategy-card {
  flex: 1;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  padding: 10pt 8pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 6pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.strategy-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 3pt;
}
.aggressive::before {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4472C4 0%, #365A8F 100%);
}
.balanced::before {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #D4AF37 0%, #C9A227 100%);
}
.conservative::before {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #70AD47 0%, #5A8F37 100%);
}
.strategy-card h3 {
  font-size: 12pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 5pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: center;
}
.strategy-card .icon {
  font-size: 20pt;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 5pt 0;
}
.strategy-card .allocation {
  font-size: 7pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  margin: 5pt 0;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.strategy-card .return {
  font-size: 8pt;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 5pt;
  padding-top: 5pt;
}
.aggressive .return { color: #4472C4; }
.balanced .return { color: #D4AF37; }
.conservative .return { color: #70AD47; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>总结：稳中求进，步步为营</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <div class="summary">
    <h2>💡 2025年投资建议</h2>
    <p>采用<b>哑铃型配置策略</b>：一手抓高成长科技（AI、光通信），一手抓高红利防守（黄金、银行、能源）。根据风险偏好灵活调整配置比例。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="strategies">
    <div class="strategy-card aggressive">
      <h3>激进型</h3>
      <p class="icon">🚀</p>
      <p class="allocation"><b>配置：</b><br>AI科技50%<br>成长股30%<br>黄金10%<br>现金10%</p>
      <p class="return">预期15-25% | 高风险</p>
    </div>
    <div class="strategy-card balanced">
      <h3>稳健型</h3>
      <p class="icon">⚖️</p>
      <p class="allocation"><b>配置：</b><br>黄金30%<br>红利30%<br>AI科技25%<br>债券15%</p>
      <p class="return">预期8-15% | 中风险</p>
    </div>
    <div class="strategy-card conservative">
      <h3>保守型</h3>
      <p class="icon">🛡️</p>
      <p class="allocation"><b>配置：</b><br>红利50%<br>债券30%<br>黄金15%<br>现金5%</p>
      <p class="return">预期5-10% | 低风险</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
